{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年50歲的楊張新悅（前名張燊悅）自2007年下嫁楊哲安（Jeremy）後便淡出幕前，專心相夫教女，多年來先後誕下四名寶貝女，包括大女Lucy、二女Lily、三女Leah及孻女Lola，一家六口生活溫馨美滿。</p><p>貴為港大法律系高材生的她，與畢業</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T11:17:48.880644+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T11:01:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T11:11:12.195695+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T11:11:12.195695+00:00","content_hash":"8131a0419c7dc72aa2838f007a06721c48e1a25fd1e25be7a6a43c7d0e52b8f3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}